    CMake: set iOS bundle identifier for the sim .app (I6)
    
    simctl install failed with exit 13 "Missing bundle ID" (I5): the Xcode-generated Info.plist has no CFBundleIdentifier. Set MACOSX_BUNDLE_GUI_IDENTIFIER on ps2EntryRunner under PS2X_IS_IOS; Xcode-generator iOS executables are always bundles, so no MACOSX_BUNDLE change is needed. Desktop-inert (guard OFF on Darwin).
    
